title: "SIMPLE-Cacao-WA"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "SIMPLE-Cacao-WA contributors"
abstract: "Reproducible workflow applying published-parameter SIMPLE-Cacao to model relative climatic suitability for cocoa in Ghana and Cote d'Ivoire. Outputs are climatic-response proxies, not farm-yield predictions."
version: "0.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-22"
license: "Apache-2.0"
keywords:
